on-arrival: if (typeof Q.inflation !== 'number') Q.inflation = 65; if (typeof Q.public_support !== 'number') Q.public_support = 50; if (typeof Q.security !== 'number') Q.security = 45; if (typeof Q.stability !== 'number') Q.stability = 55; if (typeof Q.month !== 'number') Q.month = 12; if (typeof Q.year !== 'number') Q.year = 1969; if (typeof Q.party_name !== 'string') Q.party_name = 'Not selected';

ANNI DI PIOMBO

ITALY, DECEMBER 1969

A political strategy game set during Italy's Years of Lead.

The Italian Republic faces political violence, industrial unrest, economic uncertainty and a crisis of confidence in democratic institutions. Choose a party, manage your government, and face the consequences of your decisions.

- @party_select: Start Game
- @credits: Credits
- @achievements: Achievements

@party_select
title: Choose Your Party
new-page: true

ITALIAN REPUBLIC — DECEMBER 1969

Choose the political organisation you will lead. After choosing, you will go directly to the government card hand.

- @dc_start: Democrazia Cristiana (DC)
- @pci_start: Partito Comunista Italiano (PCI)
- @psi_start: Partito Socialista Italiano (PSI)
- @msi_start: Movimento Sociale Italiano (MSI)
- @main_menu: Return to title

@dc_start
title: Democrazia Cristiana
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Democrazia Cristiana (DC)'; Q.public_support = 55; Q.stability = 60; Q.security = 45; Q.inflation = 65; Q.month = 12; Q.year = 1969;

You lead the Christian Democrats, the dominant force in Italy's post-war political system. Your government must preserve order while responding to economic strain and growing political polarisation.

- @monthly_briefing: Enter Government

@pci_start
title: Partito Comunista Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Partito Comunista Italiano (PCI)'; Q.public_support = 45; Q.stability = 45; Q.security = 45; Q.inflation = 65; Q.month = 12; Q.year = 1969;

You lead the Communist opposition, seeking greater influence amid labour unrest, social conflict and political polarisation.

- @monthly_briefing: Enter Government

@psi_start
title: Partito Socialista Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Partito Socialista Italiano (PSI)'; Q.public_support = 40; Q.stability = 50; Q.security = 45; Q.inflation = 65; Q.month = 12; Q.year = 1969;

You lead the Socialists, balancing reform, coalition politics and pressure from competing political forces.

- @monthly_briefing: Enter Government

@msi_start
title: Movimento Sociale Italiano
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.party_name = 'Movimento Sociale Italiano (MSI)'; Q.public_support = 25; Q.stability = 35; Q.security = 45; Q.inflation = 65; Q.month = 12; Q.year = 1969;

You lead the neo-fascist Italian Social Movement, operating on the margins of the parliamentary system in a deeply polarised republic.

- @monthly_briefing: Enter Government

@monthly_briefing
title: Government
subtitle: Italy — [+ month +] / [+ year +]
new-page: true
is-hand: true
max-cards: 3

THE GOVERNMENT

Governing party: [+ party_name +]

The government faces economic pressure, political violence and declining confidence in public institutions. Draw policy cards from the deck and choose which initiatives to pursue.

- @policy_deck
- #advance_month

@policy_deck
title: Government Policy Deck
subtitle: Draw a policy card
is-deck: true

- #policy_deck

@economic_relief
title: Economic Relief
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: policy_deck

Your cabinet proposes emergency economic measures to ease pressure on households and restore confidence.

- @economic_relief_result: Introduce relief measures

@economic_relief_result
title: Economic Relief
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.inflation = Math.max(0, Q.inflation - 8); Q.public_support = Math.min(100, Q.public_support + 5);

The government introduces an economic relief programme. Economic pressure falls and public support improves.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

@public_security
title: Public Security
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: policy_deck

Your cabinet must respond to political violence while maintaining public order and confidence in the institutions of the Republic.

- @public_security_result: Strengthen public security

@public_security_result
title: Public Security
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.security = Math.min(100, Q.security + 10); Q.stability = Math.min(100, Q.stability + 3);

The government strengthens public security. The immediate sense of order improves, though the long-term political consequences remain uncertain.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

@institutional_reform
title: Institutional Reform
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: policy_deck

Your cabinet proposes institutional reforms intended to restore confidence in the Italian Republic.

- @institutional_reform_result: Begin institutional reform

@institutional_reform_result
title: Institutional Reform
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.stability = Math.min(100, Q.stability + 8); Q.public_support = Math.min(100, Q.public_support + 3);

The government begins institutional reform. Political stability and public support improve.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

@advance_month
title: End the Month
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advance_month
new-page: true

on-arrival: Q.month = Q.month + 1; if (Q.month > 12) { Q.month = 1; Q.year = Q.year + 1; } Q.inflation = Math.min(100, Q.inflation + 2); Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 1);

The month ends. Economic pressure rises and political stability comes under renewed strain.

- @monthly_briefing: Begin next month

